{'symbol': 'CRL', 'date': '2023-01-05 10:17:00', 'title': 'ARLINGTON CAPITAL PARTNERS ANNOUNCES THE ACQUISITION OF AVS BIO', 'text': "WASHINGTON--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ARLINGTON CAPITAL PARTNERS (“ARLINGTON”), A WASHINGTON, DC-AREA PRIVATE EQUITY FIRM, ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS ACQUIRED CHARLES RIVER LABORATORIES' (NYSE:CRL) AVIAN VACCINE SERVICES BUSINESS TO FORM A NEW COMPANY, AVS BIO (THE “COMPANY”). THE COMPANY WILL OPERATE INDEPENDENTLY AS A STANDALONE PLATFORM FOR ARLINGTON THAT WILL SERVE THE BIOLOGIC MANUFACTURING AND BIOPROCESSING MARKETS."}